      equipment: 'Dominoes, Cribbage board (or score sheet).',
      dealing: "All 28 tiles are face-down and shuffled. Each player draws 6 tiles. Two from each hand are discarded into a four-tile 'Crib' belonging to the dealer. One tile is turned over from the boneyard as the 'Starter'.",
