    turnFlow: '1. Pegging Phase: Starting with the non-dealer, players play one tile at a time, keeping a running total of the pips (0-31 limit). Points scored for reaching exactly 15 or 31, and for sequences or blocks of same-value tiles.\n2. The Show: After pegging, players score their remaining 4 tiles + the starter tile for combinations.\n3. The Crib: The dealer scores the 4 discarded tiles + the starter tile.',
